"Convert documents (ODT, DOCX, TXT, MD, RTF, XLSX, PPTX, etc.) to PDF with "
"headless LibreOffice. The output is written next to the source file"
msgstr ""
"Belgeleri (ODT, DOCX, TXT, MD, RTF, XLSX, PPTX vb.) headless LibreOffice ile "
